the top ten ways to remove a heavy iron ball (going from memory).
also, three of the methods are not really true (just yet, anyway).

10: read a not cursed scroll of remove curse.
 9: polymorph the ball into a helium balloon (now you're levitating).
 8: cancel yourself.
 7: pray to your (happy) god.
 6: sell the ball to a (hardware, weapon, general goods)
    shopkeeper who will remove the chain for a nominal fee.
 5: get a rust monster to eat the ball/chain.
 4: get a rock mole to eat the ball/chain.
 3: self-polymorph into a monster whose form doesn't allow it
    to be chained.
 2: self-polymorph into a nymph and simply remove it.
 1: convince a nymph to steal it from you.

